# Testing molecular dynamics with MiLaDy and NDM

From a MiLaDy-generated potential (bispectrum_so4) for tungsten, computes short molecular dynamics from .cin file with NDM.

# Compilation
Compile Milady with NDM : cmake .. -MLD_NDM=ON

# Input files
Inputs from fit_tests/train_tests/fit01:
- name.in
- g2b4_snap1_params.pot
- vacancy.ml

MD inputs:
- vacancy.din
- vacancy.cin
